      "number": 640,
      "title": "build(deps): bump dopplerhq/secrets-fetch-action from 1.3.1 to 2.0.0",
      "body": "Bumps [dopplerhq/secrets-fetch-action](https://github.com/dopplerhq/secrets-fetch-action) from 1.3.1 to 2.0.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/dopplerhq/secrets-fetch-action/releases\">dopplerhq/secrets-fetch-action's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v2.0.0</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Upgrade node to v24 by <a href=\"https://github.com/amoses12\"><code>@​amoses12</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/DopplerHQ/secrets-fetch-action/pull/32\">DopplerHQ/secrets-fetch-action#32</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/amoses12\"><code>@​amoses12</code></a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/DopplerHQ/secrets-fetch-action/pull/32\">DopplerHQ/secrets-fetch-action#32</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/DopplerHQ/secrets-fetch-action/compare/v1.3.1...v2.0.0\">https://github.com/DopplerHQ/secrets-fetch-action/compare/v1.3.1...v2.0.0</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/DopplerHQ/secrets-fetch-action/commit/451892f16195f9ac360e1a5bcbf0b5fd0e957534\"><code>451892f</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/dopplerhq/secrets-fetch-action/issues/32\">#32</a> from DopplerHQ/austin/upgrade-node-24</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/DopplerHQ/secrets-fetch-action/commit/ca339b7022d9e564b575d68b8b64ed9d6a5f2147\"><code>ca339b7</code></a> Upgrade node to v24</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/DopplerHQ/secrets-fetch-action/commit/b7c99fb9519d23c9bb361c72b96093a914c09132\"><code>b7c99fb</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/dopplerhq/secrets-fetch-action/issues/29\">#29</a> from DopplerHQ/njackson/add-api-client-tests</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/DopplerHQ/secrets-fetch-action/commit/e6e1fc45868ee73eec4dcd3258195ac18dd6580d\"><code>e6e1fc4</code></a> Add api client tests covering secrets fetching and retry logic</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/dopplerhq/secrets-fetch-action/compare/v1.3.1...v2.0.0\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n",
